WEBVTT

00:12:27.537 --> 00:12:32.037
There's just you just have to do this
one one little thing or do more.

00:12:32.537 --> 00:12:34.496
Barista knows the feeling

00:12:34.496 --> 00:12:37.079
at a certain point when the
evidence is overwhelming.

00:12:37.371 --> 00:12:41.829
You have to ask yourself, is this
grit or is it blindness

00:12:41.996 --> 00:12:45.329
or is it just my own ego that's
getting in the way?

00:12:45.662 --> 00:12:46.787
When you reach that point,

00:12:47.121 --> 00:12:51.329
you might find that an antidote to
escalation of commitment is another

00:12:51.329 --> 00:12:56.371
commitment. But to go the opposite way,
a plan to pull the plug.

00:12:57.037 --> 00:13:00.954
And Janis created a clever strategy,
a one year exit plan.